📖 Important Reading Note

Some of Harari's interpretations—particularly about prehistoric societies, agriculture, religion, and human evolution—are interpretive and debated by historians, archaeologists, and other scholars. Don't treat every claim as settled scientific fact.

That's actually part of the lesson:

> Read big ideas, but develop the judgment to question them.



